    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "All previous\nFEBRUARY 19th, 1952\nDC-6 Sleeper Service\nCANADA-USA- HAWAII - FIJI\nAUSTRALIA - NEW ZEALAND\n•.\nBritish Commonwealth\nPacific Airlines Ltd.\nAll information contained herein subject to change\nwithout notice",
      "You sleep like a top in these roomy, luxuriously-appointed, full-\nlength sleepers.\nArrive at your destination after a good night's\nsleep, refreshed-ready for business or pleasure.\nAsk your Travel Agent about the B.C.P.A. Service\nB.C.P.A. OFFICES\nHEAD OFFICE: A.P.A. Building, 53 Martin Place, Sydney.\nPhone BW 2741(15 lines).\nSAN FRANCISCO: 347 Stockton St., San Francisco.\nPhone YUkon 2-3670.\nFIJI: Nandi Airport and Victoria Parade, Suva.\nB.C.P.A. AGENTS\nAUSTRALIA: T.A.A., 339 Swanston St., Melbourne, Cl. Booking\nOffices all States.\nNEW ZEALAND: N.Z.N.A.C.,\nAuckland, C.l.\n•Agencies throughout N.2.\nCommerce Street,\nHONOLULU: Theo. H. Davies \u0026 Co., Limited, Davies Building,\nU.S.A.: B.O.A.C.: New York,\n342 Madison Ave.,\nNew York 17,\nN.Y. Also Chicago, Los Angeles, Washington, Boston, Miami\nCANADA: T.C.A., 656 Howe Street, Vancouver, B.C. Offices\nmajor cities.\nU.K. and elsewhere: B.O.A.C\nPRINTED IN AUSTRALIA. 5191/2\nJOHN SANDS PTY. LTD. SYDNEY"
    ],
